flowchart TD
    A[Staff selects Billing] --> B[Enter customer ID]
    B --> C{Customer exists?}
    C -- No --> Z1[Show error, return to menu]
    C -- Yes --> D[Add item IDs and quantities]
    D --> E{Stock sufficient<br/>for every item?}
    E -- No --> Z2[Reject bill,<br/>no stock changed]
    E -- Yes --> F[Enter discount percent]
    F --> G[Calculate subtotal,<br/>discount and 3% GST]
    G --> H[Deduct stock for each item]
    H --> I[Save bill to data/bills.csv]
    I --> J[Print invoice]
